{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S01、S04、S05较多围绕如何暴露喜欢、会不会给对方造成负担、会不会显得太黏展开，容易把主线带向表达心意时的自我保护与关系风险。\",\n    \"S06的孤单主要来自对方不知道他经历过怎样的害怕，偏向内心无法被理解，而非亲密本身甜蜜与易逝交织的痛楚。\",\n    \"S07把重点转向对方是否需要自己、未来是否会想到自己，带有把亲密关系转化为持续陪伴和被需要的愿望的倾向。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03略微加入了确认对方是否也觉得亲近美好的愿望，S13则短暂突出索要未来保证的冲动，但两者都仍然服务于害怕失去眼下亲密的核心矛盾。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y更完整地把亲密带来的幸福、双方相互需要的满足，以及明知这份亲密无法保证长久的痛楚缠在一起：越享受、越舍不得，越感到未来可能失去的疼痛。X也包含这些元素，但更多篇幅被表达心意的顾虑、害怕给对方负担和希望持续被需要等相邻问题牵引，中心的情感纠缠不如Y集中。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4c5677e3-247e-4e97-9c5e-2101d8680f35", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T100953077197Z", "elapsed_seconds": 19.532, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:10:12.616075+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3a94b09503d3dbc2675ecb62e1d5635d8aa5e30a38c2b5c4d49a5bd9e738c0f7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc